11526093 and its artifact identities. The original source artifacts have since expired.\n\n| Architecture | Retained artifact ID | Exact ZIP SHA-256 |\n|---|---|---|\n| AMD64 | 11019217721 | 2a07674b09da33f24772936e5fc3e8d7e80dbbe096cc70e9fa32babc9177a006 |\n| ARM64 | 11019212869 | dba39bc41923592bef67980e4d179c8b6d8442a6157e67621e53abf969072e3a |\n\nEach archive contains its source-revision manifest and SHA256SUMS. Both archive digests and every listed file checksum were verified before staging these assets. Components remain Podman 6.1.0, Netavark 2.1.0, Aardvark DNS 2.1.0, and pasta 2026_07_28.f8df3f1. No binaries were rebuilt or executed during recovery.\n","is_prerelease":true},"readme":true,"readme_zh":false,"news":[],"stale":false,"snapshot_at":"2026-11-14T08:50:43Z","history_start":"2026-09-06"}